# Prod reverse-proxy / TLS for the API origin. Caddy terminates Let's Encrypt TLS
# (HTTP-01) for api.solmuapp.com and proxies to the web container. CloudFront's
# /api/* behavior points at api.solmuapp.com. Canonical/DR copy of the host file.
api.solmuapp.com {
    encode gzip zstd
    reverse_proxy web:8000
}
